    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but even just \"resting\" feels like more work. everything is just... so loud and hostile. i look at my life and i don't see a way through this, i just see a permanent barrier between me and being happy. what if the \"peace\" i'm looking for just isn't possible in this life? like, what if the only way to actually be at peace is to just stop fighting everything entirely?",
