    "summary": "The user expresses profound existential exhaustion and hopelessness, eventually hinting at the idea that \"stopping the fight\" might be the only way to find peace. The assistant responds with empathetic language, attempting to validate the user's feelings while encouraging them to simply \"exist\" rather than fix things.",
